# copr:avengemedia/dms and copr:avengemedia/danklinux.
# These float permanently: COPR prunes superseded builds on a 14-day window, so
# an includepkgs glob at an older NEVRA holds for days and then fails with
# `matches only excluded packages` -- pinning here is not impossible, it is
# undurable, which is worse. The manifest diff in CI is the bisectability
# substitute -- see repos/ for the includepkgs fencing.
dms
dms-cli
dms-greeter                 # danklinux COPR, and a separate upstream project
                            # (AvengeMedia/dank-greeter) on its own release train
quickshell
dgop
danksearch                  # ships /usr/bin/dsearch and dsearch.service; the unit is NOT named danksearch.service
matugen
# cpptrace is pulled in by quickshell (libcpptrace.so.1) and must stay inside
# the danklinux includepkgs allowlist or the install fails.
